": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLW-K8jf-l8Q7kNvwEyhIwT&_nc_oc=AdqzfGNybxYx52s4_lWq92LLyDQjP1ycgmZWwUuOQgQw8gRfb54-azyZtTMt-moSxnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3SgwhXjEWap-Hhqg1TlX9AOxihG5-ydpXBdW8QPjxRw&oe=6B032462"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzkE_je8iGsQ7kNvwFO4VPL&_nc_oc=Adp1krlmGgmsyJ4J1fSfPvcqejTv78ahBjgZ0LwJTZqvVNZ9FJ1wvg4oZR7vHkfcgeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRvRKUwkVRSfv99vqFM_3C7fiDcsPs33wV1KVXPEjmjQA&oe=6B030BB6"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WbvdjPVE5AsQ7kNvwHN4Jgs&_nc_oc=AdpI6aHrJBC1ep8huHhPSrZE89_oLprHmqSQzf61BVqBDH1UskEwwuEnnJxRdu4YkTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLcyDLC5sKFwJ6ptHUi2rt0f6Jl3UIHjw-i0XOXk8E4w&oe=6B031324"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jYiKKCAbjD0Q7kNvwHy6b5n&_nc_oc=AdrOen2qM-4zYVR9NShahfxxJIe4WHGQxJfWg3SZ51aNdpeiz5TxzCFrp3gc7c_X5nU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLI8idjmmYiUUZgKxdKha4yJjkafsAE3SLh6V1_l0Ekg&oe=6B0330D0"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FZEHblVVCkQ7kNvwFGmYpt&_nc_oc=AdqnOSupv2_O0qtWAh2by3DkN-BvLmWr4gT6HYwq0kt9oAG7gB_qK3qn7Mqul1xunaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8mlZHxchWiWGPVjVLawT4FQsbVwVeVN9FPnM5oXTJxA&oe=6B032B61"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y49mnJW-v8oQ7kNvwFTgAfo&_nc_oc=AdrzcWdz6YN-l7bUsX0vwpQ2qywUf-ZVb5X_uNr7chtFTQRPds522gGFwBI4NL_lNso&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTI9RoduEG6eXVOYVVAPI7sGcRr0g1y4oNfanLsAdwIyA&oe=6B03161E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SIgEFI0eRlgQ7kNvwH16lIR&_nc_oc=Adrzt73B--ngzX9KcZr_KSEBa_YGZh3wsv7V6Q85vd_Ggng5bGzxhV2_7j9PH-CniAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9yxAV9jIDil19R2S6toMuFD0aov8Dfam3QOY7eV6qEQ&oe=6B032BBB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nyQsGD-BIqoQ7kNvwE7jbjs&_nc_oc=Adr3Oux7YY0PMm2_-_5Te3ukXdVJyjZ1BSGRKGXY-Af5aneckUiSZTF6HcmUtcLsLpY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJcFZm6_ZrYaTjl7ryAZ-sWbgtzrANJ2vVBiKQcJKrTw&oe=6B0317E1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oDF9nBvZBkQ7kNvwFNR43m&_nc_oc=AdrDl_V__pg3nVfn7XnLFftv3CoTUlS05a9TTksRpkdhxMQDMZccqA8o2MWz9iouFag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_UNwNRqShQMz-mQstljo4-VzngBgk_tTN